&lt;h2 id=&#34;-documentation&#34;&gt;📖 Documentation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please navigate to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://nuclei.projectdiscovery.io&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://nuclei.projectdiscovery.io&lt;/a&gt; for detailed documentation to &lt;strong&gt;build&lt;/strong&gt; new or your own &lt;strong&gt;custom&lt;/strong&gt; templates.
We have also added a set of templates to help you understand how things work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-contributions&#34;&gt;💪 Contributions
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nuclei-templates is powered by major contributions from the community.
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/issues/new?assignees=&amp;amp;labels=&amp;amp;template=submit-template.md&amp;amp;title=%5Bnuclei-template%5D&amp;#43;&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Template contributions &lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/issues/new?assignees=&amp;amp;labels=&amp;amp;template=feature_request.md&amp;amp;title=%5BFeature%5D&amp;#43;&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Feature Requests&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/issues/new?assignees=&amp;amp;labels=&amp;amp;template=bug_report.md&amp;amp;title=%5BBug%5D&amp;#43;&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Bug Reports&lt;/a&gt; are more than welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://repobeats.axiom.co/api/embed/55ee65543bb9a0f9c797626c4e66d472a517d17c.svg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Alt&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-discussion&#34;&gt;💬 Discussion
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have questions / doubts / ideas to discuss?
Feel free to open a discussion on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/discussions&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Github discussions&lt;/a&gt; board.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-community&#34;&gt;👨‍💻 Community
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are welcome to join the active &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/projectdiscovery&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord Community&lt;/a&gt; to discuss directly with project maintainers and share things with others around security and automation.
Additionally, you may follow us on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://twitter.com/pdnuclei&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
